(3105216, 436403, 46993, '<td valign="top">It was a toss-up for me between this and another photo for the blue (which means NOTHING).  It seems like I never get close.  The sky is great.  You get a real deep, rich feel of dimension.  Great color, nice composition.  It feels candid even if it wasn''t.  Super job.</td>', 'It was a toss-up for me between this and another photo for the blue (which means NOTHING).  It seems like I never get close.  The sky is great.  You get a real deep, rich feel of dimension.  Great color, nice composition.  It feels candid even if it wasn''t.  Super job.', '2006-12-11 00:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
