(3105226, 434836, 40718, '<td valign="top">The good: I like the textures on her face.  The composition is nice too.<br/>The bad: The glove suffers from all the little spectral highlights.  It may be from USM?  The glove also seems to blend with the background or her hair too much.  There isn''t enough separation.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'The good: I like the textures on her face.  The composition is nice too.The bad: The glove suffers from all the little spectral highlights.  It may be from USM?  The glove also seems to blend with the background or her hair too much.  There isn''t enough separation.Score: 6', '2006-12-11 00:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105228, 436758, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I love the DOF and the blur of the eye.  Great detail on the hand.</td>', 'Excellent.  I love the DOF and the blur of the eye.  Great detail on the hand.', '2006-12-11 00:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
