(3105282, 436984, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, wouldn''t we all like her to be around to do a little light cleaning?  I''m pretty loose with DNMC, so I''m not gonna totally can this one, but I will dock a point or two for a fairly loose association.  The highlight on the wall is too bad. 5</td>', 'Well, wouldn''t we all like her to be around to do a little light cleaning?  I''m pretty loose with DNMC, so I''m not gonna totally can this one, but I will dock a point or two for a fairly loose association.  The highlight on the wall is too bad. 5', '2006-12-11 00:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105286, 436629, 40718, '<td valign="top">It looks like the camera chose to focus on the end of his nose instead of his eyes. That''s too bad as portraits always want the sharpest portion to be the eyes.  Were the lines just a bit to the right, I would have liked the idea of the natural frame. 5</td>', 'It looks like the camera chose to focus on the end of his nose instead of his eyes. That''s too bad as portraits always want the sharpest portion to be the eyes.  Were the lines just a bit to the right, I would have liked the idea of the natural frame. 5', '2006-12-11 00:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
