(3106970, 436153, 64795, '<td valign="top">I wish her shirt was more neutral, so the full attention was on her face.  I really like this picture though.</td>', 'I wish her shirt was more neutral, so the full attention was on her face.  I really like this picture though.', '2006-12-11 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
