(3106976, 437092, 58728, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable.  I personally think that kids sometimes look the cutest with they are filthy!  ;)  Lovely lighting, clarity, and the eyes pop really well.  10 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable.  I personally think that kids sometimes look the cutest with they are filthy!  ;)  Lovely lighting, clarity, and the eyes pop really well.  10 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-11 16:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106979, 435445, 58728, '<td valign="top">I just love this photo.  IMHO, i wish there wasn''t such a tight crop at the bottom, but i''m just being super nit-picky.  I still give it a 10.  Wonderfully done.  :)</td>', 'I just love this photo.  IMHO, i wish there wasn''t such a tight crop at the bottom, but i''m just being super nit-picky.  I still give it a 10.  Wonderfully done.  :)', '2006-12-11 16:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
