(3106984, 436992, 58728, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  I love the painting with light effect, and your little teeny plant is so sharp.  I''m loving the composition and the glow.  Great picture.  10.  Good luck with this one. :)</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I love the painting with light effect, and your little teeny plant is so sharp.  I''m loving the composition and the glow.  Great picture.  10.  Good luck with this one. :)', '2006-12-11 16:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
