(3106988, 436867, 58728, '<td valign="top">One of my faves from teh challenge.  Excellent lighting and composition.  A very mysterious looking photo...I find myself trying to see where the tracks lead.  And i really like this funky border. It''s very original.  10.</td>', 'One of my faves from teh challenge.  Excellent lighting and composition.  A very mysterious looking photo...I find myself trying to see where the tracks lead.  And i really like this funky border. It''s very original.  10.', '2006-12-11 16:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106990, 435652, 58728, '<td valign="top">Very lovely photo.  The child is giving us the feeling of desperation...between her look,, and the dirt on her.  And especially the setting, and the withered flowers.  Very eerie.  I really like it.  Excellent clarity and colors, togehter with a somber mood.  10.</td>', 'Very lovely photo.  The child is giving us the feeling of desperation...between her look,, and the dirt on her.  And especially the setting, and the withered flowers.  Very eerie.  I really like it.  Excellent clarity and colors, togehter with a somber mood.  10.', '2006-12-11 16:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106992, 436758, 58728, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  i really love the texture of the fingers, and the lighting is fantastic.  I also like the pose and the crop.  It''s very refreshing!  10.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  i really love the texture of the fingers, and the lighting is fantastic.  I also like the pose and the crop.  It''s very refreshing!  10.', '2006-12-11 16:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106997, 436263, 58728, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  The pig is so cute...and dirty!  Look at that snout!  I also love what you did with the pp here. The border also works IMO.  :)  <br/>10.</td>', 'I really like this image.  The pig is so cute...and dirty!  Look at that snout!  I also love what you did with the pp here. The border also works IMO.  :)  10.', '2006-12-11 16:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107000, 437005, 58728, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal!  I hope this ribbons.  She is FILTHY!  It''s great! The lighting, contrast...wonderful.  And very powerful eyes.  Fantastic job.  I''m jealous.  I hope one day I can make a picture like that!  10!</td>', 'Phenomenal!  I hope this ribbons.  She is FILTHY!  It''s great! The lighting, contrast...wonderful.  And very powerful eyes.  Fantastic job.  I''m jealous.  I hope one day I can make a picture like that!  10!', '2006-12-11 16:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107002, 436828, 58728, '<td valign="top">They are sooooo cute!  I just love cows.  Great expressions on their faces.  I wonder what you did to make them all look right at you??  :)  Excellent crop.  10 from me.</td>', 'They are sooooo cute!  I just love cows.  Great expressions on their faces.  I wonder what you did to make them all look right at you??  :)  Excellent crop.  10 from me.', '2006-12-11 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107004, 436938, 58728, '<td valign="top">Simple and powerful.  It makes me wonder about the person who owns them.  Excellent crop, colors, dof.  one of my faves of the challenge.  10.</td>', 'Simple and powerful.  It makes me wonder about the person who owns them.  Excellent crop, colors, dof.  one of my faves of the challenge.  10.', '2006-12-11 16:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107010, 436989, 63503, '<td valign="top">overdone and therefore blatantly artificial</td>', 'overdone and therefore blatantly artificial', '2006-12-11 16:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107014, 436789, 58728, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I love it.  The background and the carrots contrast really well. Awesome comp and crop.  ;)  10.  Good luck in the challenge, I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Very creative. I love it.  The background and the carrots contrast really well. Awesome comp and crop.  ;)  10.  Good luck in the challenge, I hope it does well for you.', '2006-12-11 16:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107016, 436828, 50578, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The cows could be a tad sharper,  but otherwise  nice work. hope it scores well</td>', 'I like this.  The cows could be a tad sharper,  but otherwise  nice work. hope it scores well', '2006-12-11 16:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107017, 436989, 58728, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done.  I love the crop here, and I love the feeling of togetherness...like they are all depending on one another for support.  Great job.</td>', 'Wonderfully done.  I love the crop here, and I love the feeling of togetherness...like they are all depending on one another for support.  Great job.', '2006-12-11 16:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107021, 437054, 58728, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  I like the lighting here.  A less tighter crop IMHO may have helped...since his chin is slightly cut off.  a 9 form me.  :)</td>', 'Nice portrait.  I like the lighting here.  A less tighter crop IMHO may have helped...since his chin is slightly cut off.  a 9 form me.  :)', '2006-12-11 16:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107023, 436153, 58728, '<td valign="top">Nice image here.  The lighting is great...and her expression is priceless.  And a perfect amount of dirt.  :)  Excellent eye detail as well.  9.</td>', 'Nice image here.  The lighting is great...and her expression is priceless.  And a perfect amount of dirt.  :)  Excellent eye detail as well.  9.', '2006-12-11 16:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107030, 436350, 58728, '<td valign="top">Sexy!  It''s a funky pose and i really like the composition and angles.  There''s even dirt under her fingernail!  i love it. :)</td>', 'Sexy!  It''s a funky pose and i really like the composition and angles.  There''s even dirt under her fingernail!  i love it. :)', '2006-12-11 16:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
