(3107342, 436432, 40718, '<td valign="top">Sigh, I discovered my camera was broken when I was at a quarry trying to shoot one of those massive dump trucks, so we were on the same page for ideas.  The sunlight is a bit bright or harsh, but not too bad.  I wish we could figure out a composition where we could enjoy his face as well as the juxtaposition of his toys. 5</td>', 'Sigh, I discovered my camera was broken when I was at a quarry trying to shoot one of those massive dump trucks, so we were on the same page for ideas.  The sunlight is a bit bright or harsh, but not too bad.  I wish we could figure out a composition where we could enjoy his face as well as the juxtaposition of his toys. 5', '2006-12-11 18:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
