(3107390, 436943, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the hidden nature of the tractor.  It makes it seem like you just didn''t get to the proper place for a good shot. (I''m sure you were probably limited by where you could go.) 4</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the hidden nature of the tractor.  It makes it seem like you just didn''t get to the proper place for a good shot. (I''m sure you were probably limited by where you could go.) 4', '2006-12-11 18:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107394, 436153, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice expression and the eyes are sharp.  Both bonuses for a good portrait.  I was looking for even more dirt.  This seems too "made up" as I don''t see much in her hair.  Still, not bad. 6</td>', 'Nice expression and the eyes are sharp.  Both bonuses for a good portrait.  I was looking for even more dirt.  This seems too "made up" as I don''t see much in her hair.  Still, not bad. 6', '2006-12-11 18:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107400, 436739, 40718, '<td valign="top">Too static.  A creative approach, but just doesn''t have much appeal as a photograph outside of the challenge. 4</td>', 'Too static.  A creative approach, but just doesn''t have much appeal as a photograph outside of the challenge. 4', '2006-12-11 18:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107401, 437020, 40718, '<td valign="top">Would have been better without that light on the left.  A nice furtive expression. 5</td>', 'Would have been better without that light on the left.  A nice furtive expression. 5', '2006-12-11 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107405, 435948, 40718, '<td valign="top">One slight objection is the dirt on the spade blends so well with the back it almost looks like one of those optical illusions where dimensions are warped.  Otherwise the biggest issue is the static nature of the composition. 5</td>', 'One slight objection is the dirt on the spade blends so well with the back it almost looks like one of those optical illusions where dimensions are warped.  Otherwise the biggest issue is the static nature of the composition. 5', '2006-12-11 18:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107406, 436879, 40718, '<td valign="top">Moon shots all by themselves, no matter how zoomed, are usually a bit sterile and ultimately don''t hold our attention that long. 5</td>', 'Moon shots all by themselves, no matter how zoomed, are usually a bit sterile and ultimately don''t hold our attention that long. 5', '2006-12-11 18:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107409, 436028, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nice picture in itself.  If you added the grain, kudos and kudos again.  It''s a bit of a stretch on the dirt part, but I''m not going to let that get in my way. one point dock. 7</td>', 'A nice picture in itself.  If you added the grain, kudos and kudos again.  It''s a bit of a stretch on the dirt part, but I''m not going to let that get in my way. one point dock. 7', '2006-12-11 18:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107411, 436483, 40718, '<td valign="top">The dirt in the palm actually makes the picture look setup.  I do like the conversion to B&amp;W and the composition is nice. 6</td>', 'The dirt in the palm actually makes the picture look setup.  I do like the conversion to B&W and the composition is nice. 6', '2006-12-11 18:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107414, 436923, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very centered.  The movement is nice, but it still feels static to me.  The lighting is a bit harsh. 4</td>', 'Very centered.  The movement is nice, but it still feels static to me.  The lighting is a bit harsh. 4', '2006-12-11 18:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107418, 436905, 40718, '<td valign="top">The application of dirt is interesting, but ultimately I don''t quite get it.  I think it''s the scalloped nature of the edges. 5</td>', 'The application of dirt is interesting, but ultimately I don''t quite get it.  I think it''s the scalloped nature of the edges. 5', '2006-12-11 18:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107423, 436664, 40718, '<td valign="top">Moon shots, no matter how close all by themselves are usually fairly boring.  This is a tiny bit better because, well, it is really, really zoomed, eh? 6</td>', 'Moon shots, no matter how close all by themselves are usually fairly boring.  This is a tiny bit better because, well, it is really, really zoomed, eh? 6', '2006-12-11 18:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107424, 436153, 42198, '<td valign="top">Great expression. Her hair really fits the image as well! Nice composition and DOF. My only criticism is the eyes look overdone (too much dodging)</td>', 'Great expression. Her hair really fits the image as well! Nice composition and DOF. My only criticism is the eyes look overdone (too much dodging)', '2006-12-11 18:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107426, 436964, 40718, '<td valign="top">Heh, I snickered when I saw this one in the thumbs.  A cute little bum shot.  I think I would have added waaaay more bubbles just to make it more interesting and then kept it in color. 6</td>', 'Heh, I snickered when I saw this one in the thumbs.  A cute little bum shot.  I think I would have added waaaay more bubbles just to make it more interesting and then kept it in color. 6', '2006-12-11 18:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107445, 436989, 62727, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Did they enjoy being models?</td>', 'Yikes!  Did they enjoy being models?', '2006-12-11 19:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107449, 436290, 40718, '<td valign="top">How DPC does Dirt.  Only here would the model have their skin so creamy white in a dirt challenge.  It''s a well done shot, but I''m saving my 8-10 scores for true grime. 7  This looks like Cindi''s work.</td>', 'How DPC does Dirt.  Only here would the model have their skin so creamy white in a dirt challenge.  It''s a well done shot, but I''m saving my 8-10 scores for true grime. 7  This looks like Cindi''s work.', '2006-12-11 19:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107457, 437109, 62727, '<td valign="top">Pretty corn!  Looks alot like mine.</td>', 'Pretty corn!  Looks alot like mine.', '2006-12-11 19:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107462, 435969, 62727, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2006-12-11 19:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107489, 436789, 51793, '<td valign="top">What did you use as a backdrop in this picture?</td>', 'What did you use as a backdrop in this picture?', '2006-12-11 19:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107492, 436629, 67553, '<td valign="top">I''m too distracted by the streaks on the window.</td>', 'I''m too distracted by the streaks on the window.', '2006-12-11 19:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107495, 436984, 67553, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but I think I would have softened it up a bit and shortened the DOF.</td>', 'Lovely, but I think I would have softened it up a bit and shortened the DOF.', '2006-12-11 19:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107496, 436890, 67553, '<td valign="top">I like the processing on this one, but can''t decide if the subject is supposed to be the guy, or the head in the window.</td>', 'I like the processing on this one, but can''t decide if the subject is supposed to be the guy, or the head in the window.', '2006-12-11 19:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107498, 437115, 67553, '<td valign="top">Great detail.</td>', 'Great detail.', '2006-12-11 19:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107499, 436674, 51793, '<td valign="top">What is with the trash bags?</td>', 'What is with the trash bags?', '2006-12-11 19:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107500, 435969, 67553, '<td valign="top">Great concept and well executed!</td>', 'Great concept and well executed!', '2006-12-11 19:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107501, 436282, 51793, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of hard to see your hand but I like the idea.</td>', 'It''s kind of hard to see your hand but I like the idea.', '2006-12-11 19:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107503, 435652, 67553, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far!  I love the angle, lighting, expression. . .   Well done!</td>', 'My favorite so far!  I love the angle, lighting, expression. . .   Well done!', '2006-12-11 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107504, 434805, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the rustic pattern here and colors.  My brain can definitely recognize this texture -  As I write this I want to know more about this animal.  Very beautiful.</td>', 'I like the rustic pattern here and colors.  My brain can definitely recognize this texture -  As I write this I want to know more about this animal.  Very beautiful.', '2006-12-11 19:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107510, 435984, 67553, '<td valign="top">This could have used more contrast in my opinion.  The earth colors are too bland.</td>', 'This could have used more contrast in my opinion.  The earth colors are too bland.', '2006-12-11 19:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107511, 437085, 67553, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better without the truck.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better without the truck.', '2006-12-11 19:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107512, 436772, 67553, '<td valign="top">Cool!  I''ll bet he had a blast doing this shot!  :)</td>', 'Cool!  I''ll bet he had a blast doing this shot!  :)', '2006-12-11 19:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107514, 435803, 38032, '<td valign="top">Here''s something with meaning!  Thank you.  I like the desaturation and the graves in the background.  The can of whatever it is definitely distracts but overall this is powerful and makes me get a lump in the throat.</td>', 'Here''s something with meaning!  Thank you.  I like the desaturation and the graves in the background.  The can of whatever it is definitely distracts but overall this is powerful and makes me get a lump in the throat.', '2006-12-11 19:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107518, 437005, 9833, '<td valign="top">Awesome.</td>', 'Awesome.', '2006-12-11 19:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107520, 436985, 9833, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting.</td>', 'Nice color and lighting.', '2006-12-11 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107525, 436350, 38032, '<td valign="top">Definitely gritty and scary - great colors and beautiful model -  the crop makes the pose look a tad forced.</td>', 'Definitely gritty and scary - great colors and beautiful model -  the crop makes the pose look a tad forced.', '2006-12-11 19:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107527, 436067, 38032, '<td valign="top">love that.  It''s a great saying and a great humorous photo.</td>', 'love that.  It''s a great saying and a great humorous photo.', '2006-12-11 19:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107528, 436828, 45475, '<td valign="top">Already voted and came back to comment. This is the most delightful image of cows I''ve ever seen. How on earth did you manage to get them to pose for you? And did you get out of the trench in time?? :D Great capture. Unforgettable. Would be overjoyed to see this get the blue ribbon...</td>', 'Already voted and came back to comment. This is the most delightful image of cows I''ve ever seen. How on earth did you manage to get them to pose for you? And did you get out of the trench in time?? :D Great capture. Unforgettable. Would be overjoyed to see this get the blue ribbon...', '2006-12-11 19:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107531, 436774, 38032, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a bit more of the terrain here.</td>', 'I would like to see a bit more of the terrain here.', '2006-12-11 19:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107537, 435984, 38032, '<td valign="top">This has a nice yin/yang composition ... but it needs more contrast - Perhaps since the light was behind the subject, it was too tough to see the dirt?</td>', 'This has a nice yin/yang composition ... but it needs more contrast - Perhaps since the light was behind the subject, it was too tough to see the dirt?', '2006-12-11 19:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107560, 435984, 66384, '<td valign="top">LOL. I can''t stand it. The sunset is just as bad as the dirt pile. Nice diagonal. Jeez, I''m still laughing. That''s the worst looking picture I ever saw. 8</td>', 'LOL. I can''t stand it. The sunset is just as bad as the dirt pile. Nice diagonal. Jeez, I''m still laughing. That''s the worst looking picture I ever saw. 8', '2006-12-11 19:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107564, 436848, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nice one...</td>', 'Nice one...', '2006-12-11 19:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107565, 436840, 48228, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened on the mountains...</td>', 'Oversharpened on the mountains...', '2006-12-11 19:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107589, 436903, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent..... love the textures here.....</td>', 'Excellent..... love the textures here.....', '2006-12-11 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107594, 436791, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent and very very clever.....</td>', 'Excellent and very very clever.....', '2006-12-11 20:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107599, 436836, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very clever...</td>', 'Very clever...', '2006-12-11 20:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107600, 436828, 66384, '<td valign="top">Good laugh. They are so curious and confused by you and your camera. There are a lot of dirty knees in this shot. I like the tight crop.</td>', 'Good laugh. They are so curious and confused by you and your camera. There are a lot of dirty knees in this shot. I like the tight crop.', '2006-12-11 20:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107603, 436985, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent..... love this one.....</td>', 'Excellent..... love this one.....', '2006-12-11 20:10:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3107606, 436938, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2006-12-11 20:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107607, 436789, 48228, '<td valign="top">very good..... I also love the strong color contrast.....</td>', 'very good..... I also love the strong color contrast.....', '2006-12-11 20:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107613, 436629, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a cute idea, and a really sweet look.</td>', 'This is a cute idea, and a really sweet look.', '2006-12-11 20:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107615, 435955, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2006-12-11 20:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107618, 436263, 48228, '<td valign="top">Love this one.....</td>', 'Love this one.....', '2006-12-11 20:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107624, 435593, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well said, and well photographed.</td>', 'Well said, and well photographed.', '2006-12-11 20:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107627, 436739, 48228, '<td valign="top">I would have given this a very high score, if one just had some, just a little pile of compost or dirt somewhere. I really love this composition of this one.....</td>', 'I would have given this a very high score, if one just had some, just a little pile of compost or dirt somewhere. I really love this composition of this one.....', '2006-12-11 20:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107631, 436290, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent..... love this one.....</td>', 'Excellent..... love this one.....', '2006-12-11 20:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107642, 437117, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice red white and blue to go with the dirt balls, um I mean snowballs. (I always hated it when my snowballs picked up dirt after all that rolling effort.)</td>', 'Nice red white and blue to go with the dirt balls, um I mean snowballs. (I always hated it when my snowballs picked up dirt after all that rolling effort.)', '2006-12-11 20:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107645, 435756, 5112, '<td valign="top">The title is perfect for this image.  Love the soft blues into grey/whites, and the dirt showing through.  One thing you might consider doing is to crop a bit more off top and bottom, to get rid of the darker blueish line at the bottom, and tha partial dirt/ice things at the top; just for a slightly clearner look.    ~8</td>', 'The title is perfect for this image.  Love the soft blues into grey/whites, and the dirt showing through.  One thing you might consider doing is to crop a bit more off top and bottom, to get rid of the darker blueish line at the bottom, and tha partial dirt/ice things at the top; just for a slightly clearner look.    ~8', '2006-12-11 20:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107654, 436878, 5112, '<td valign="top">Perfect dirt on white picture!  Sandy dirt.  The colours are great.  As a picture, by itself, outside of the "dirt" challenge, I don''t know, it''s very clean and professional, but it doesn''t have much to offer outside of that.  For the challenge, it''s great.  ~9</td>', 'Perfect dirt on white picture!  Sandy dirt.  The colours are great.  As a picture, by itself, outside of the "dirt" challenge, I don''t know, it''s very clean and professional, but it doesn''t have much to offer outside of that.  For the challenge, it''s great.  ~9', '2006-12-11 20:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107656, 437072, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice to see that dirt doesn''t have to be ugly. Lovely shot.</td>', 'Nice to see that dirt doesn''t have to be ugly. Lovely shot.', '2006-12-11 20:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107657, 436910, 47541, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and the "arrow" formed by the dust is nice<br/>10</td>', 'Lovely colours and the "arrow" formed by the dust is nice10', '2006-12-11 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107658, 436048, 47541, '<td valign="top">I dont know why but I really like this - fantastic colours<br/>10</td>', 'I dont know why but I really like this - fantastic colours10', '2006-12-11 20:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107663, 436964, 5112, '<td valign="top">So you blackmailed the kid to let you take pictures by letting him (her?) doodle on your walls?  Neat.  Good candid.  ~7</td>', 'So you blackmailed the kid to let you take pictures by letting him (her?) doodle on your walls?  Neat.  Good candid.  ~7', '2006-12-11 20:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107666, 436153, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great eyes and expression.  I''d have cloned the image on the shirt as its a little distracting<br/>10</td>', 'Great eyes and expression.  I''d have cloned the image on the shirt as its a little distracting10', '2006-12-11 20:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107667, 437086, 47541, '<td valign="top">Very nice - the darkened patches at the top draw attention firmly down to the horse.  Live the dust cloud too<br/>10</td>', 'Very nice - the darkened patches at the top draw attention firmly down to the horse.  Live the dust cloud too10', '2006-12-11 20:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107669, 436828, 47541, '<td valign="top">Funny.  I like cows.  I can picture you sitting in the middle of a paddock and all the cows coming over to see what you are up to!<br/>10</td>', 'Funny.  I like cows.  I can picture you sitting in the middle of a paddock and all the cows coming over to see what you are up to!10', '2006-12-11 20:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107670, 436828, 5112, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Judy''s pictures, beautiful cows, great angle.  Is this Judy?  Good entry for dirt, good title.  The cows have a sort of halo around them (angelic cows?) :)  ~7</td>', 'This reminds me of Judy''s pictures, beautiful cows, great angle.  Is this Judy?  Good entry for dirt, good title.  The cows have a sort of halo around them (angelic cows?) :)  ~7', '2006-12-11 20:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107673, 437006, 47541, '<td valign="top">The dog makes this shot.  He is so funny watching the horse rolling.</td>', 'The dog makes this shot.  He is so funny watching the horse rolling.', '2006-12-11 20:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107675, 437047, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very good entry.  I like the concept, and I like the execution.  The light is beautiful (is it evening light?).  It shines on the flowers/flags, and a bit on the grasses behind them, like a beautiful backdrop, but the grave and dirt aroud it are in shadow for the most part.  Great match for the challenge.  ~9</td>', 'Very good entry.  I like the concept, and I like the execution.  The light is beautiful (is it evening light?).  It shines on the flowers/flags, and a bit on the grasses behind them, like a beautiful backdrop, but the grave and dirt aroud it are in shadow for the most part.  Great match for the challenge.  ~9', '2006-12-11 20:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107679, 436263, 66384, '<td valign="top">Fun. "That''s some pig"</td>', 'Fun. "That''s some pig"', '2006-12-11 20:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107686, 436350, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, great expression, interesting composition<br/>9</td>', 'Nicely lit, great expression, interesting composition9', '2006-12-11 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107688, 437095, 47541, '<td valign="top">Simple and while I can''t tell why, I like this<br/>9</td>', 'Simple and while I can''t tell why, I like this9', '2006-12-11 20:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107690, 436410, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, good leading lines, I wish the sky was a more natural colour<br/>9</td>', 'Nice colours, good leading lines, I wish the sky was a more natural colour9', '2006-12-11 20:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107691, 436236, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for cat photos and this is a great capture<br/>8</td>', 'I''m a sucker for cat photos and this is a great capture8', '2006-12-11 20:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107695, 434696, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful geometric abstract.  I like it that it isn''t totally straight, and I really like the pattern of the screen on the left hand side.  IMVHO the raised border (the cream coloured frame) is a bit distracting, because the rest of it is so geometric and angular, and the frame is sort of soft looking, and, at least to my eyes, they don''t really quite match.  ~8</td>', 'Beautiful geometric abstract.  I like it that it isn''t totally straight, and I really like the pattern of the screen on the left hand side.  IMVHO the raised border (the cream coloured frame) is a bit distracting, because the rest of it is so geometric and angular, and the frame is sort of soft looking, and, at least to my eyes, they don''t really quite match.  ~8', '2006-12-11 20:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107698, 436867, 5112, '<td valign="top">Looks like the tracks from a giant jeep going over a rounded shape, like a little earth.  Very beautiful.  I like the sense of anxiety that you get from the top/bottom frames, they sort of "compress" the image and make it urgent.  ~9</td>', 'Looks like the tracks from a giant jeep going over a rounded shape, like a little earth.  Very beautiful.  I like the sense of anxiety that you get from the top/bottom frames, they sort of "compress" the image and make it urgent.  ~9', '2006-12-11 20:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107703, 435652, 5112, '<td valign="top">Manny?  She looks almost too clean for a "dirt" challenge :)  Beautiful picture, sort of risky, I think.  I think most people wouldn''t put the girl at the edge in the middle there, and the big wall overpowering the right hand side, but it works!  Two things I would consider (if I dare) - (1) to make her dirtier, maybe the dress dirtier; (2) to put the dead flowers to the other side and her more in the bottom corner, maybe even try to increase the sense of almost vertigo.  The light is great.  ~8</td>', 'Manny?  She looks almost too clean for a "dirt" challenge :)  Beautiful picture, sort of risky, I think.  I think most people wouldn''t put the girl at the edge in the middle there, and the big wall overpowering the right hand side, but it works!  Two things I would consider (if I dare) - (1) to make her dirtier, maybe the dress dirtier; (2) to put the dead flowers to the other side and her more in the bottom corner, maybe even try to increase the sense of almost vertigo.  The light is great.  ~8', '2006-12-11 20:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107704, 436290, 47541, '<td valign="top">Very Anne Geddes like - a bit oversharpened and could do with rotating a bit<br/>8</td>', 'Very Anne Geddes like - a bit oversharpened and could do with rotating a bit8', '2006-12-11 20:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107708, 436416, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice splash of colour in what''s a dull topic<br/>8</td>', 'Nice splash of colour in what''s a dull topic8', '2006-12-11 20:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107710, 435593, 5112, '<td valign="top">The idea is good (for this challenge), but I think the start, black background doesn''t do much to sell it (the idea).  There seems to be a connection missing somehow, a reader, a printing press, a place where they sell these things, something.  As it is, it''s just floating there on black.  ~6</td>', 'The idea is good (for this challenge), but I think the start, black background doesn''t do much to sell it (the idea).  There seems to be a connection missing somehow, a reader, a printing press, a place where they sell these things, something.  As it is, it''s just floating there on black.  ~6', '2006-12-11 20:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
