(3107726, 437005, 5112, '<td valign="top">Odd picture.  The hair and shoulders look almost like a negative, whereas the face/neck don''t.  It''s a beautiful image in a way, although, what is missing (to me) is any reason why such a beautiful young woman would get all muddy like that, especially with makeup on.  ~9</td>', 'Odd picture.  The hair and shoulders look almost like a negative, whereas the face/neck don''t.  It''s a beautiful image in a way, although, what is missing (to me) is any reason why such a beautiful young woman would get all muddy like that, especially with makeup on.  ~9', '2006-12-11 20:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
