(3107730, 435415, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yeah!  Love it.  Great entry for the challenge.  Love the square crop.  If I were to suggest an improvement, I''d try (1) a cleaner looking towel for the hair (on my monitor it looks like it needs a wash); (2) a crop that would not include the little bits of squares at the top end of the photo; (3) a bit more sharpness on the cucumbers.  ~8</td>', 'Yeah!  Love it.  Great entry for the challenge.  Love the square crop.  If I were to suggest an improvement, I''d try (1) a cleaner looking towel for the hair (on my monitor it looks like it needs a wash); (2) a crop that would not include the little bits of squares at the top end of the photo; (3) a bit more sharpness on the cucumbers.  ~8', '2006-12-11 20:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107733, 435969, 25270, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Great composition.</td>', 'Very well done.  Great composition.', '2006-12-11 20:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107737, 436290, 25270, '<td valign="top">Great idea and perfect execution!</td>', 'Great idea and perfect execution!', '2006-12-11 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107740, 436416, 5112, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to figure out the title.  I really like this entry.  Very creative.  Is this at a cemetery?  Or, what is the thing at the top right?  I hope you didn''t have to break all those beautiful little roses just for this picture, that would be a shame.  Is that ice?  ~9</td>', 'Took me a moment to figure out the title.  I really like this entry.  Very creative.  Is this at a cemetery?  Or, what is the thing at the top right?  I hope you didn''t have to break all those beautiful little roses just for this picture, that would be a shame.  Is that ice?  ~9', '2006-12-11 20:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107757, 436153, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I think I''ve seen this little girl before.  You need to give your kids a bath on occasion, you know :)))) (or send them to the beach).  It''s a good entry to the challenge.  I wish the shirt were a plain fabric (the print looks like a pickle with wings).  Did you try a closer crop?  ~8</td>', 'Hmmm.  I think I''ve seen this little girl before.  You need to give your kids a bath on occasion, you know :)))) (or send them to the beach).  It''s a good entry to the challenge.  I wish the shirt were a plain fabric (the print looks like a pickle with wings).  Did you try a closer crop?  ~8', '2006-12-11 21:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107761, 437086, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is good!  My favourite so far.  Perfect for the challenge.  ~10</td>', 'Hey, this is good!  My favourite so far.  Perfect for the challenge.  ~10', '2006-12-11 21:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
