(3107768, 437109, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, a snake!  Love the orange on brown.  It''s probably not the best match for "dirt", because the snake draws so much attention to itself.  ~6</td>', 'Ahhh, a snake!  Love the orange on brown.  It''s probably not the best match for "dirt", because the snake draws so much attention to itself.  ~6', '2006-12-11 21:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107775, 437085, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice.  It does give the feel of going down a country road.  I like the fence silhouette in back.  I wonder if you could get some dust from the wheels in it to make it more realistic, and maybe place the horizon line a bit higher in the frame to give it a more dynamic look.  ~7</td>', 'Nice.  It does give the feel of going down a country road.  I like the fence silhouette in back.  I wonder if you could get some dust from the wheels in it to make it more realistic, and maybe place the horizon line a bit higher in the frame to give it a more dynamic look.  ~7', '2006-12-11 21:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107776, 436713, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Love this one.  It''s just right the way it is.  ~10</td>', 'Beautiful!  Love this one.  It''s just right the way it is.  ~10', '2006-12-11 21:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107778, 437008, 5112, '<td valign="top">Perfect expressions!  Good entry.  ~8</td>', 'Perfect expressions!  Good entry.  ~8', '2006-12-11 21:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
