(3107801, 435969, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  This is a funny picture.  Such a clean hand coming out of the dirt, and the water is not running off the leaf.  Very curious.  ~7</td>', 'Hmmmm.  This is a funny picture.  Such a clean hand coming out of the dirt, and the water is not running off the leaf.  Very curious.  ~7', '2006-12-11 21:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
