(3108651, 436774, 67671, '<td valign="top">should have smeared some dirt on the tyres, they look too pristeen, good idea, and well composed.</td>', 'should have smeared some dirt on the tyres, they look too pristeen, good idea, and well composed.', '2006-12-12 06:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108669, 436890, 38032, '<td valign="top">This has so many great things about it but I can''t help but think that the pose seems unnatural - as if the camera is so close that the man is trying to allow focus on the background and himself by leaning back toward the window.  This has huge potential for some sort of message It think - especially with the mannequin head.  also: Taking away the logo hat and fleece jacket could make this more timeless me thinks.</td>', 'This has so many great things about it but I can''t help but think that the pose seems unnatural - as if the camera is so close that the man is trying to allow focus on the background and himself by leaning back toward the window.  This has huge potential for some sort of message It think - especially with the mannequin head.  also: Taking away the logo hat and fleece jacket could make this more timeless me thinks.', '2006-12-12 06:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108671, 436916, 38032, '<td valign="top">awesome.  the only thing that would make this better would be some interaction between the man and the instuments of his sport.</td>', 'awesome.  the only thing that would make this better would be some interaction between the man and the instuments of his sport.', '2006-12-12 06:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108678, 436290, 38032, '<td valign="top">It must have been interesting to decide what expression the model would have - perhaps there was only one choice.  I like the clean background and specks of dirt - The hair is sorta funny because it seems so perfect under that dirt :] I''m trying to figure out what would bring this together more for me I need to feel more connection between humanity and the plant - like maybe his fingers become roots - at this point is just seems like a cruel Anne Geddes satire - if that''s the idea, it''s GROWing on me as I write this.</td>', 'It must have been interesting to decide what expression the model would have - perhaps there was only one choice.  I like the clean background and specks of dirt - The hair is sorta funny because it seems so perfect under that dirt :] I''m trying to figure out what would bring this together more for me I need to feel more connection between humanity and the plant - like maybe his fingers become roots - at this point is just seems like a cruel Anne Geddes satire - if that''s the idea, it''s GROWing on me as I write this.', '2006-12-12 07:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108679, 436989, 38032, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how well a studio and mud-faced children works - I like that one madel faces the camera, as if asking for help while the others are just too weak and disheartened.</td>', 'I''m not sure how well a studio and mud-faced children works - I like that one madel faces the camera, as if asking for help while the others are just too weak and disheartened.', '2006-12-12 07:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108681, 436263, 38032, '<td valign="top">Don''t tell me I am what I eat! ... the grungy treatmment here is great.  Composition looks just  a bit slanty and almost-centered. 7</td>', 'Don''t tell me I am what I eat! ... the grungy treatmment here is great.  Composition looks just  a bit slanty and almost-centered. 7', '2006-12-12 07:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108682, 437095, 57882, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture here.  Very abstract.  Good work.</td>', 'I really like the texture here.  Very abstract.  Good work.', '2006-12-12 07:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108684, 437055, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject - The look on her face could mean so many things ... but this doesn''t scream poor to me.  Embroidered cardigan, bottled water, woven bag ... OK - so perhaps these are the spoils of a day asking others for help - but success in begging just reduces the feeling of poverty that''s all - Squeezing into the challenge to say ''dirt poor'' might be a stretch.  Based on the image alone  - I would have liked to see a bit more of the surrounding area.  6</td>', 'This is a great subject - The look on her face could mean so many things ... but this doesn''t scream poor to me.  Embroidered cardigan, bottled water, woven bag ... OK - so perhaps these are the spoils of a day asking others for help - but success in begging just reduces the feeling of poverty that''s all - Squeezing into the challenge to say ''dirt poor'' might be a stretch.  Based on the image alone  - I would have liked to see a bit more of the surrounding area.  6', '2006-12-12 07:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108687, 436837, 38032, '<td valign="top">It''s sorta tough to find a good crisp focal point here.- amybe stepping back a bit would work.</td>', 'It''s sorta tough to find a good crisp focal point here.- amybe stepping back a bit would work.', '2006-12-12 07:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108688, 436713, 38032, '<td valign="top">that''s pretty</td>', 'that''s pretty', '2006-12-12 07:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108689, 436048, 38032, '<td valign="top">the warm colors make this for me.</td>', 'the warm colors make this for me.', '2006-12-12 07:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108691, 435414, 38032, '<td valign="top">Ahhh - there''s some effort!  Definitely leaves a bad taste in your mouth ;]  The super dark drit against the skin is great - well composed too. 9</td>', 'Ahhh - there''s some effort!  Definitely leaves a bad taste in your mouth ;]  The super dark drit against the skin is great - well composed too. 9', '2006-12-12 07:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108692, 437005, 38032, '<td valign="top">beautiful, yet forced.</td>', 'beautiful, yet forced.', '2006-12-12 07:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108694, 434880, 38032, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and subject but i think it needs more image detail - looks too tightly cropped or over-processed or something.</td>', 'I love the idea and subject but i think it needs more image detail - looks too tightly cropped or over-processed or something.', '2006-12-12 07:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108695, 437062, 38032, '<td valign="top">The crop at the top definitely jumps out as uncomfortable here.</td>', 'The crop at the top definitely jumps out as uncomfortable here.', '2006-12-12 07:20:14.000000', NULL, 1);
