(3108887, 437062, 7485, '<td valign="top">Yes it is, but the composition just doesn''t work for me, with the tip of the mound clipping the frame, the bulldozer almost out of the frame, and random buildings peeking in at the top</td>', 'Yes it is, but the composition just doesn''t work for me, with the tip of the mound clipping the frame, the bulldozer almost out of the frame, and random buildings peeking in at the top', '2006-12-12 08:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
