(3109576, 436985, 42013, '<td valign="top">NIce composition and arrangment. I''m giving you a 9 with this proviso. I have never thought of picking tomatoes as a muddy job and they don''t normally have such nice droplets of water. From a strict realism standpoint, it seems off to me. Giving the benefit of the doubt, it could just be a proud husbandman showing off the fruits of his labor so... 9 works for me.<br/> <br/>The photo is very well put toghether and from a technical standpoint it really leaves nothing behind. YOu should do well in the challenge and this is a very pleasant picture.</td>', 'NIce composition and arrangment. I''m giving you a 9 with this proviso. I have never thought of picking tomatoes as a muddy job and they don''t normally have such nice droplets of water. From a strict realism standpoint, it seems off to me. Giving the benefit of the doubt, it could just be a proud husbandman showing off the fruits of his labor so... 9 works for me. The photo is very well put toghether and from a technical standpoint it really leaves nothing behind. YOu should do well in the challenge and this is a very pleasant picture.', '2006-12-12 15:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
