(3109594, 436839, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tone and texture in this photo.  This is an image I can appreciate.  May not be glamorous enough for the masses when it comes to scoring, but it''s a well thought out shot.  Only minor negative for me on this is I think you should have moved the camera a little to the right as the bottom right corner of the photo is falling OOF.  Bottom left is sharp.  Of course that is assuming you didn''t crop the left side off.  Upper right doesn''t matter as much because the eye isn''t drawn into that corner like it is the bottom left.  Yikes.  That''s a lot of verbiage for a "minor" complaint!  :D  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful tone and texture in this photo.  This is an image I can appreciate.  May not be glamorous enough for the masses when it comes to scoring, but it''s a well thought out shot.  Only minor negative for me on this is I think you should have moved the camera a little to the right as the bottom right corner of the photo is falling OOF.  Bottom left is sharp.  Of course that is assuming you didn''t crop the left side off.  Upper right doesn''t matter as much because the eye isn''t drawn into that corner like it is the bottom left.  Yikes.  That''s a lot of verbiage for a "minor" complaint!  :D  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-12 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
