(3110623, 436867, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like Mars and the rover has run amuck!  :D  Very clever shot.  Great detail and clarity.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like Mars and the rover has run amuck!  :D  Very clever shot.  Great detail and clarity.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-12 22:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
