(3110691, 434836, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very studio-ish looking image. Sort of like an ad for "Mary Kay Cosmetics" in a "Twilight Zone" episode. I feel like I vaguely remember her from my bar-room band days. Well done tech, but not my type. I''m just a real world sort of person I guess.</td>', 'Very studio-ish looking image. Sort of like an ad for "Mary Kay Cosmetics" in a "Twilight Zone" episode. I feel like I vaguely remember her from my bar-room band days. Well done tech, but not my type. I''m just a real world sort of person I guess.', '2006-12-12 22:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
