(3110708, 435652, 69008, '<td valign="top">Color, contrast, composition, pose, choice of model, sharpness. All very good to excellent. The only thing I see not belonging is the 2nd tripod hanging on the top rail in the background. It takes some punch out of the simple line there. On the plus side, one of them frames her head.</td>', 'Color, contrast, composition, pose, choice of model, sharpness. All very good to excellent. The only thing I see not belonging is the 2nd tripod hanging on the top rail in the background. It takes some punch out of the simple line there. On the plus side, one of them frames her head.', '2006-12-12 23:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110718, 436872, 69008, '<td valign="top">"Flower in the lower right hand corner" instead of the middle might be a stronger composition, and feature the dirt better.  Nice straight on of the flower however, and happy looking dirt.</td>', '"Flower in the lower right hand corner" instead of the middle might be a stronger composition, and feature the dirt better.  Nice straight on of the flower however, and happy looking dirt.', '2006-12-12 23:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
