(3112046, 436796, 3569, '<td valign="top">yes, finally some real dirt.  Nice shot.</td>', 'yes, finally some real dirt.  Nice shot.', '2006-12-13 07:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3112189, 436910, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot.  I like the high contrast that you''ve achieved by using late/early day natural light.  The blowing sand (dirt) is an appropriate touch for this challenge.  One minor complaint; seeing as this is an advanced challenge I would have considered cloning out the top of that building (water tower?) in the background that''s poking above the treeline.  The eye is naturally drawn to it and that takes away from the overall impact of this wonderful photo.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a cool shot.  I like the high contrast that you''ve achieved by using late/early day natural light.  The blowing sand (dirt) is an appropriate touch for this challenge.  One minor complaint; seeing as this is an advanced challenge I would have considered cloning out the top of that building (water tower?) in the background that''s poking above the treeline.  The eye is naturally drawn to it and that takes away from the overall impact of this wonderful photo.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-13 08:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3112227, 436483, 30049, '<td valign="top">Things that make you go hmmmmm.  Interesting photo.  Could have worked for the ''Death'' challenge as well I guess.  Nice choice of tones to coordinate with the ''Dirt'' theme.  It would have been a little stronger if more of the image was sharper.  The hand steals the show here, yet only about half of the hand is sharply focused, while the bottom half of the image (especially the foreground top leaf) is crisp.  Either a deeper aperture to bring it all in, or a very shallow aperture to fade hard from the middle finger back (keeping the back edge of the foreground leaf and the last two fingers sharp).  All JMO of course.  Overall, well done!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Things that make you go hmmmmm.  Interesting photo.  Could have worked for the ''Death'' challenge as well I guess.  Nice choice of tones to coordinate with the ''Dirt'' theme.  It would have been a little stronger if more of the image was sharper.  The hand steals the show here, yet only about half of the hand is sharply focused, while the bottom half of the image (especially the foreground top leaf) is crisp.  Either a deeper aperture to bring it all in, or a very shallow aperture to fade hard from the middle finger back (keeping the back edge of the foreground leaf and the last two fingers sharp).  All JMO of course.  Overall, well done!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-13 08:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3112714, 437115, 65886, '<td valign="top">very nice macro and details!</td>', 'very nice macro and details!', '2006-12-13 10:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
