(3112924, 435652, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the look of this photo. The exposure, lighting, and everything are great. But I think it would be a more powerful composition if it were more tightly composed around the girl. After looking at the photo for a while, I feel drawn off the right side of the image but there is no where to go. I think that the space on the left half of the image isn''t balanced with the right side of the image (where the frame nearly touches the subject, and cuts off some of the flower stems). <br/> <br/>Great photo.</td>', 'I like the look of this photo. The exposure, lighting, and everything are great. But I think it would be a more powerful composition if it were more tightly composed around the girl. After looking at the photo for a while, I feel drawn off the right side of the image but there is no where to go. I think that the space on the left half of the image isn''t balanced with the right side of the image (where the frame nearly touches the subject, and cuts off some of the flower stems).  Great photo.', '2006-12-13 11:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
