(3113029, 436840, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape with good color.  I think the shadow (house? barn?) adds to the picture.  Looks like a bit of sensor dust on lower left sky could have been cloned out.</td>', 'Nice landscape with good color.  I think the shadow (house? barn?) adds to the picture.  Looks like a bit of sensor dust on lower left sky could have been cloned out.', '2006-12-13 11:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
