(3113461, 436758, 26255, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... The DOF feels a little shallow to me, but I''m assuming it was done intentionally.  The ring finger is borderline blown out on this monitor and could probably use a little burning in.  Overall... Nice shot! - 7</td>', 'Interesting shot... The DOF feels a little shallow to me, but I''m assuming it was done intentionally.  The ring finger is borderline blown out on this monitor and could probably use a little burning in.  Overall... Nice shot! - 7', '2006-12-13 13:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113464, 436736, 26255, '<td valign="top">The image is a little muddy to me.  More contrast might help, but the overall composition could also use some work IMHO.</td>', 'The image is a little muddy to me.  More contrast might help, but the overall composition could also use some work IMHO.', '2006-12-13 13:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113469, 436879, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but pushes the envelope for me as far as meeting the challenge is concerned. - 5</td>', 'Nice image, but pushes the envelope for me as far as meeting the challenge is concerned. - 5', '2006-12-13 13:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113474, 436955, 26255, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Seems a bit oversharpened.', '2006-12-13 13:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113479, 436911, 26255, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the challenge, but IMHO a wider angle may have served you better in this shot.  The contrast seems a little flat and the sky is uninteresting.  A slight levels adjustment and/or hue tweaking would go a long way to help this shot. - 5</td>', 'This certainly meets the challenge, but IMHO a wider angle may have served you better in this shot.  The contrast seems a little flat and the sky is uninteresting.  A slight levels adjustment and/or hue tweaking would go a long way to help this shot. - 5', '2006-12-13 13:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113482, 436901, 26255, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... focus seems a touch soft, but then there are elements that are crystal clear.  You have some weird haloing around the "dirt" coming out of the glass.  Background lacks visual appeal.  Kudos on the play on words to meet the challenge. - 4</td>', 'Hmmm... focus seems a touch soft, but then there are elements that are crystal clear.  You have some weird haloing around the "dirt" coming out of the glass.  Background lacks visual appeal.  Kudos on the play on words to meet the challenge. - 4', '2006-12-13 13:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113491, 437100, 26255, '<td valign="top">I''m compelled to ask... Why?  The only purpose for this to happen is to meet the challenge.  A technically perfect image with no meaning does not make a good photograph.  It''s been my experience that when I draw a blank on something to submit for a challenge, I simply do not enter. - 3</td>', 'I''m compelled to ask... Why?  The only purpose for this to happen is to meet the challenge.  A technically perfect image with no meaning does not make a good photograph.  It''s been my experience that when I draw a blank on something to submit for a challenge, I simply do not enter. - 3', '2006-12-13 13:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113497, 434880, 60477, '<td valign="top">This is a strong photograph...but the dirt is playing a minor role. 7.</td>', 'This is a strong photograph...but the dirt is playing a minor role. 7.', '2006-12-13 13:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3113498, 436890, 26255, '<td valign="top">Great candid... I particularly like the product placement ;-)<br/> <br/>I would love to see this in a grungy black and white... yeah, it may be overdone, but in an image like this it would work wonders!!! - 7</td>', 'Great candid... I particularly like the product placement ;-) I would love to see this in a grungy black and white... yeah, it may be overdone, but in an image like this it would work wonders!!! - 7', '2006-12-13 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
