(3116186, 436974, 6804, '<td valign="top">Ok....... I absolutely love the picture, no question about it, its a great capture.  The birds are all so evenly spaced apart, its amazing and I can clearly see dirt in the shot.  At first glance, I would have thought the birds are feeding on something, but I don''t see any of them pecking at the ground.  The detail in the dirt shows well and as it gradually lightens up in the distance it makes the earth (or dirt) an important part of the composition.  This is a really odd work of art and one of my highest rated shots in this challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'Ok....... I absolutely love the picture, no question about it, its a great capture.  The birds are all so evenly spaced apart, its amazing and I can clearly see dirt in the shot.  At first glance, I would have thought the birds are feeding on something, but I don''t see any of them pecking at the ground.  The detail in the dirt shows well and as it gradually lightens up in the distance it makes the earth (or dirt) an important part of the composition.  This is a really odd work of art and one of my highest rated shots in this challenge. Good luck!', '2006-12-14 03:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116188, 436290, 6804, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2006-12-14 03:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116420, 436410, 24454, '<td valign="top">Way to go making "dirt" look so appealing :)  This takes me back to my childhood where a huge sugar cane farm was right behind our house when we lived in Germany.   I love the deep rich colors.</td>', 'Way to go making "dirt" look so appealing :)  This takes me back to my childhood where a huge sugar cane farm was right behind our house when we lived in Germany.   I love the deep rich colors.', '2006-12-14 07:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116473, 436350, 62187, '<td valign="top">Sweet photo...I''d have given it a 10 if I was voting this time around. Good luck to ya.</td>', 'Sweet photo...I''d have given it a 10 if I was voting this time around. Good luck to ya.', '2006-12-14 08:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116478, 436879, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how many people don''t think that the moon is dirt. I can''t wait to read the other comments made to you...nothing bad but you''ll see why I''m curious.</td>', 'It''s amazing how many people don''t think that the moon is dirt. I can''t wait to read the other comments made to you...nothing bad but you''ll see why I''m curious.', '2006-12-14 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116482, 437060, 62187, '<td valign="top">What a great photo...I hope your not getting bashed to much with stuff like ''this is not dirt''...think outside the box, that''s what I say. Nice job and good luck!</td>', 'What a great photo...I hope your not getting bashed to much with stuff like ''this is not dirt''...think outside the box, that''s what I say. Nice job and good luck!', '2006-12-14 08:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116485, 436894, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like your photo. I hope your not getting to much grief about it not being ''dirt'' in the literal sense. Great job!</td>', 'I like your photo. I hope your not getting to much grief about it not being ''dirt'' in the literal sense. Great job!', '2006-12-14 08:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116490, 437005, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting in this challenge but I would have given your photo a 10. Good luck to ya! Ok, update - I looked thru all the photos, I think yours is the winner. Maybe some of those ''hand'' photos will edge it out but...this photo is tops to me. Great job!</td>', 'I''m not voting in this challenge but I would have given your photo a 10. Good luck to ya! Ok, update - I looked thru all the photos, I think yours is the winner. Maybe some of those ''hand'' photos will edge it out but...this photo is tops to me. Great job!', '2006-12-14 08:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116491, 436410, 2240, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting picture , I like the angle.</td>', 'This is a very interesting picture , I like the angle.', '2006-12-14 08:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116495, 436796, 2240, '<td valign="top">Vroommmm</td>', 'Vroommmm', '2006-12-14 08:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116574, 436067, 2240, '<td valign="top">This gave me a laugh :) Well done, I have done this and been there. 10</td>', 'This gave me a laugh :) Well done, I have done this and been there. 10', '2006-12-14 08:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116725, 436290, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic.  I hope to see it on the front page soon!</td>', 'This is fantastic.  I hope to see it on the front page soon!', '2006-12-14 09:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116755, 434805, 24073, '<td valign="top">Im a fan of simplicity, however this one lacks interest.  I''ll place bets on this one finishing dead middle of the pack.  GL.</td>', 'Im a fan of simplicity, however this one lacks interest.  I''ll place bets on this one finishing dead middle of the pack.  GL.', '2006-12-14 10:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116757, 436410, 24073, '<td valign="top">Too much post process with the sky.</td>', 'Too much post process with the sky.', '2006-12-14 10:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116760, 436649, 24073, '<td valign="top">Most of it is!  GL.</td>', 'Most of it is!  GL.', '2006-12-14 10:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116777, 435548, 24073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, nice vision and fantastic execution.  gl.</td>', 'Beautiful, nice vision and fantastic execution.  gl.', '2006-12-14 10:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116838, 436432, 24073, '<td valign="top">Cute, and the colors are electric.  Meets the challenge well, its going to be hard for anybody to give this less than a 6.  I will go above that because I think it is very practical, and the simplicity of its nature makes it creative.  Great work.   GL.</td>', 'Cute, and the colors are electric.  Meets the challenge well, its going to be hard for anybody to give this less than a 6.  I will go above that because I think it is very practical, and the simplicity of its nature makes it creative.  Great work.   GL.', '2006-12-14 10:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116847, 436939, 24073, '<td valign="top">Looks like home, very nice.</td>', 'Looks like home, very nice.', '2006-12-14 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116862, 436890, 24073, '<td valign="top">wierd enough to keep me interested.  Mannequins totally freak me out.  GL.</td>', 'wierd enough to keep me interested.  Mannequins totally freak me out.  GL.', '2006-12-14 10:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116866, 436984, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, though I think its going to get the hard knocks for no dirt.  If this finishes low in the challenge it is probably due to DNMC''s, because aside from that it is a lovely image.</td>', 'This is a great photo, though I think its going to get the hard knocks for no dirt.  If this finishes low in the challenge it is probably due to DNMC''s, because aside from that it is a lovely image.', '2006-12-14 10:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116874, 436872, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp picture, but the flower is more of the subject than the dirt (at least to me).  The yellow/green combination really stand out.</td>', 'Nice sharp picture, but the flower is more of the subject than the dirt (at least to me).  The yellow/green combination really stand out.', '2006-12-14 10:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116879, 437010, 42495, '<td valign="top">Sensor dust?  That qualifies for dirt, so you''ll get no DNMC from me, but there''s not much here to hold my attention.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Sensor dust?  That qualifies for dirt, so you''ll get no DNMC from me, but there''s not much here to hold my attention.  Nice lighting.', '2006-12-14 10:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116882, 436905, 24073, '<td valign="top">Something in the composition is throwing me off, I''m not good enough to know what exactly.  Im thinking "maybe" the lack of light on the subjects face, and not enough reflected light behind the subjects hair.  I will study this a bit more.  Still way above avg. and very nice.</td>', 'Something in the composition is throwing me off, I''m not good enough to know what exactly.  Im thinking "maybe" the lack of light on the subjects face, and not enough reflected light behind the subjects hair.  I will study this a bit more.  Still way above avg. and very nice.', '2006-12-14 10:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116887, 436403, 24073, '<td valign="top">Great direction, and this should score well.  Focus, focus, focus in the sky.  An otherwise 9 in my book. 8.</td>', 'Great direction, and this should score well.  Focus, focus, focus in the sky.  An otherwise 9 in my book. 8.', '2006-12-14 10:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116893, 435998, 24073, '<td valign="top">Great light, great composition. 1pt. minus for a DNMC, because I just don''t think it fits the bill perfectly, but still a very, very good photo.</td>', 'Great light, great composition. 1pt. minus for a DNMC, because I just don''t think it fits the bill perfectly, but still a very, very good photo.', '2006-12-14 10:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116900, 436483, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the B&amp;W conversion.  The leaves really add to the picture.</td>', 'Nice job on the B&W conversion.  The leaves really add to the picture.', '2006-12-14 10:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3116903, 436878, 42495, '<td valign="top">For some reason I find this picture funny and I really like it.  It''s a well done, simple picture of dirt.</td>', 'For some reason I find this picture funny and I really like it.  It''s a well done, simple picture of dirt.', '2006-12-14 10:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117009, 437115, 5112, '<td valign="top">They dig by hand?  :)  Good shot.  I like the diagonal.  ~7</td>', 'They dig by hand?  :)  Good shot.  I like the diagonal.  ~7', '2006-12-14 11:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117025, 436980, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is really good, a face made of the cracks/shapes in the mud.    However, it probably is not the best idea to sell "dirt" in the challenge.  From a technical point of view, it looks overprocessed, sort of like too much HDR or something like that.  ~4</td>', 'I think the idea is really good, a face made of the cracks/shapes in the mud.    However, it probably is not the best idea to sell "dirt" in the challenge.  From a technical point of view, it looks overprocessed, sort of like too much HDR or something like that.  ~4', '2006-12-14 11:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117036, 436789, 5112, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colours!  Lovely presentation.  ~9</td>', 'Fantastic colours!  Lovely presentation.  ~9', '2006-12-14 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117132, 436909, 67671, '<td valign="top">The lights to the right are just so distracting</td>', 'The lights to the right are just so distracting', '2006-12-14 11:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117201, 436939, 69350, '<td valign="top">I cannot vote yet but this is a great entry.</td>', 'I cannot vote yet but this is a great entry.', '2006-12-14 12:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117203, 436153, 69350, '<td valign="top">I cannot vote yet but this is a great entry. She looks like a younger version of Nicole Kidmann.</td>', 'I cannot vote yet but this is a great entry. She looks like a younger version of Nicole Kidmann.', '2006-12-14 12:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117305, 436949, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice job on using the dirt to amplify the life lines.  Whatever your model is holding seems kind of "busy" to me.  Perhaps a simpler prop would keep the emphasis on the hands.</td>', 'Nice job on using the dirt to amplify the life lines.  Whatever your model is holding seems kind of "busy" to me.  Perhaps a simpler prop would keep the emphasis on the hands.', '2006-12-14 12:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117309, 436955, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the duck, but I don''t really see how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Nice picture of the duck, but I don''t really see how it meets the challenge.', '2006-12-14 12:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117314, 437011, 42495, '<td valign="top">Without your title, this is a real stretch for meeting the challenge.  I do like the composition and I get the feeling that the model is indeed engaging in something...</td>', 'Without your title, this is a real stretch for meeting the challenge.  I do like the composition and I get the feeling that the model is indeed engaging in something...', '2006-12-14 12:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117315, 436867, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the stark lighting here and composition.  The border doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'I like the stark lighting here and composition.  The border doesn''t really work for me.', '2006-12-14 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117321, 436547, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like your processing, but it''s a bit of a stretch for "dirt".  Without the title I''d have no clue as to what the truck is.</td>', 'I like your processing, but it''s a bit of a stretch for "dirt".  Without the title I''d have no clue as to what the truck is.', '2006-12-14 12:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117324, 435998, 42495, '<td valign="top">Really good B&amp;W conversion, but I just don''t see the dirt.</td>', 'Really good B&W conversion, but I just don''t see the dirt.', '2006-12-14 12:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117329, 437116, 42495, '<td valign="top">Clever!  I like that you chose a nice colorful bag to get all dirty.</td>', 'Clever!  I like that you chose a nice colorful bag to get all dirty.', '2006-12-14 12:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117338, 436608, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and compsition, and your title fits it well.  The greenish tone doesn''t work for me; I think more brown/black when it comes to dirt.</td>', 'Good lighting and compsition, and your title fits it well.  The greenish tone doesn''t work for me; I think more brown/black when it comes to dirt.', '2006-12-14 12:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117342, 436144, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and processing.</td>', 'Nice colors and processing.', '2006-12-14 12:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117354, 435803, 42495, '<td valign="top">Selective desat works great here.  One of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'Selective desat works great here.  One of the best of the challenge.', '2006-12-14 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117386, 436410, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am not particularly keen on your post-processing.  The canes actually change colour as they hit the horizon, and the horizon itself seems tobe showing signs of chromatic abberation.  I suspect that you have boosted the contrast level a great deal - personally I would have prferred a more subtle approach.</td>', 'I am not particularly keen on your post-processing.  The canes actually change colour as they hit the horizon, and the horizon itself seems tobe showing signs of chromatic abberation.  I suspect that you have boosted the contrast level a great deal - personally I would have prferred a more subtle approach.', '2006-12-14 13:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117392, 435948, 67258, '<td valign="top">Focus, exposure etc are fine, but the composition doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Focus, exposure etc are fine, but the composition doesn''t work for me.', '2006-12-14 13:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117398, 437109, 67258, '<td valign="top">Compositionally an uncomfortable shot to view - it seems that this is just a quick snapshot, with no prior conception of what the end photograph would look like.</td>', 'Compositionally an uncomfortable shot to view - it seems that this is just a quick snapshot, with no prior conception of what the end photograph would look like.', '2006-12-14 13:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117402, 436878, 67258, '<td valign="top">I find this a bit stark and dull.</td>', 'I find this a bit stark and dull.', '2006-12-14 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117427, 437095, 67258, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I have a problem in voting for this one, as I haven''t got a clue what I am looking at, nor how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm, I have a problem in voting for this one, as I haven''t got a clue what I am looking at, nor how it meets the challenge.', '2006-12-14 13:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117432, 436791, 67258, '<td valign="top">LOL - and nicely done, too.</td>', 'LOL - and nicely done, too.', '2006-12-14 13:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117452, 437116, 67258, '<td valign="top">I think I am going to puke.... 7 for the photography and the concept, but I am taking one away for making me feel ill!</td>', 'I think I am going to puke.... 7 for the photography and the concept, but I am taking one away for making me feel ill!', '2006-12-14 13:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117455, 437008, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very well done!</td>', 'Very well done!', '2006-12-14 13:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117464, 436984, 67258, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t <b>look[b]</b> very ''dirty'' - I feel that the costume and title require a much more raunchy pose and expression.</td>', 'She doesn''t look[b] very ''dirty'' - I feel that the costume and title require a much more raunchy pose and expression.', '2006-12-14 13:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117466, 436837, 67258, '<td valign="top">Focus isn''t very sharp</td>', 'Focus isn''t very sharp', '2006-12-14 13:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117475, 436879, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, possibly a cultural thing?</td>', 'I don''t get the title, possibly a cultural thing?', '2006-12-14 13:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117477, 436141, 67258, '<td valign="top">Loks like gravel to me - I am getting thoroughly confused by the American definition of dirt!  Nonetheless an ok photo.</td>', 'Loks like gravel to me - I am getting thoroughly confused by the American definition of dirt!  Nonetheless an ok photo.', '2006-12-14 13:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117479, 436890, 67258, '<td valign="top">Now, this I get, I understand, and I like!</td>', 'Now, this I get, I understand, and I like!', '2006-12-14 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117487, 437100, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nor can I!  A bit random, but I like random.</td>', 'Nor can I!  A bit random, but I like random.', '2006-12-14 13:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117490, 436547, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ahh, a muck spreader - love the photo and it certainly meets the challenge from a British perspective!</td>', 'Ahh, a muck spreader - love the photo and it certainly meets the challenge from a British perspective!', '2006-12-14 13:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3117497, 437005, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very, very disconcerting! But more original and better done than the majority of photos I have seen so far.  I shall come back to vote as I want to see fresh.</td>', 'Very, very disconcerting! But more original and better done than the majority of photos I have seen so far.  I shall come back to vote as I want to see fresh.', '2006-12-14 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
