(3125292, 436989, 44882, '<td valign="top">There is too much dirt to make this look real, the photo is too dark, and it is a pitty the two girls have they eyes closed.</td>', 'There is too much dirt to make this look real, the photo is too dark, and it is a pitty the two girls have they eyes closed.', '2006-12-17 10:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125426, 436828, 44490, '<td valign="top">Ha!  What did you have to get their attention like that?  Something yummy?  Good lighting, DOF.  Made me laugh - love it.</td>', 'Ha!  What did you have to get their attention like that?  Something yummy?  Good lighting, DOF.  Made me laugh - love it.', '2006-12-17 11:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125439, 436985, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement/composition.  I think that a touch more saturation would help both the tomatoes and the stems.</td>', 'Nice arrangement/composition.  I think that a touch more saturation would help both the tomatoes and the stems.', '2006-12-17 11:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125444, 435414, 44490, '<td valign="top">Timfy, is that you?  Hang in there, help is on the way?  Great setup, texture, feeling, dirt on skin, hope it does well.</td>', 'Timfy, is that you?  Hang in there, help is on the way?  Great setup, texture, feeling, dirt on skin, hope it does well.', '2006-12-17 11:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125445, 436153, 44490, '<td valign="top">Love the expression, combination of dirt and pink, focus on her left eye, nicely done.</td>', 'Love the expression, combination of dirt and pink, focus on her left eye, nicely done.', '2006-12-17 11:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125446, 436740, 44490, '<td valign="top">Striking expression, lighting, blue eyes - strong and effective.</td>', 'Striking expression, lighting, blue eyes - strong and effective.', '2006-12-17 11:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125447, 434836, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination of textures, skin, hair, glove, wall, nice composition and lighting.  The drawn lines would probably be better if they were smudged a little.</td>', 'Interesting combination of textures, skin, hair, glove, wall, nice composition and lighting.  The drawn lines would probably be better if they were smudged a little.', '2006-12-17 11:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125448, 435878, 44490, '<td valign="top">So cute, and with a nice amount of dirt on the face to fit the challenge.  Made me smile.</td>', 'So cute, and with a nice amount of dirt on the face to fit the challenge.  Made me smile.', '2006-12-17 11:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125454, 436290, 44490, '<td valign="top">Ha, just too funny and too cute, reminiscent of Anne Geddes, but a little more mature.  Made me smile, love it.</td>', 'Ha, just too funny and too cute, reminiscent of Anne Geddes, but a little more mature.  Made me smile, love it.', '2006-12-17 11:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125455, 437005, 44490, '<td valign="top">Even with all that dirt, there''s an amazing beauty to her and the image.  Nice focus on eyes, DOF, texture, drip from chin.  Love it.</td>', 'Even with all that dirt, there''s an amazing beauty to her and the image.  Nice focus on eyes, DOF, texture, drip from chin.  Love it.', '2006-12-17 11:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125458, 436992, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good execution, striking and effective, nicely done.</td>', 'Nice idea and good execution, striking and effective, nicely done.', '2006-12-17 11:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125462, 437087, 44490, '<td valign="top">Striking image, wonderful lighting, DOF, detail in both plant and soil, interesting natural angle.  Love it.</td>', 'Striking image, wonderful lighting, DOF, detail in both plant and soil, interesting natural angle.  Love it.', '2006-12-17 11:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125465, 436800, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast in snow and earth, sun and shadow, sky and clouds, especially covering the dynamic range.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely contrast in snow and earth, sun and shadow, sky and clouds, especially covering the dynamic range.  Nicely done.', '2006-12-17 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125467, 436791, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge, a smart way to get a pretty image, and I bet that it was pretty good tasting as well.  Lovely arrangement, nice DOF, gold fork, flower, and trim - beautiful and tasteful.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge, a smart way to get a pretty image, and I bet that it was pretty good tasting as well.  Lovely arrangement, nice DOF, gold fork, flower, and trim - beautiful and tasteful.', '2006-12-17 11:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125474, 436067, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good story, strong, with lots of dirt, good lighting.  It might be better if you backed away a touch, as the image is definitely in-your-face, but maybe that''s fitting.</td>', 'Good story, strong, with lots of dirt, good lighting.  It might be better if you backed away a touch, as the image is definitely in-your-face, but maybe that''s fitting.', '2006-12-17 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125476, 435756, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of earth, snow, ice pools, and fitting title.  Love it.</td>', 'Nice combination of earth, snow, ice pools, and fitting title.  Love it.', '2006-12-17 11:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125479, 436848, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, colors, textures, road, buildings in the background, idea of fruit from the earth.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'Nice landscape, colors, textures, road, buildings in the background, idea of fruit from the earth.  I like it a lot.', '2006-12-17 11:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125484, 435969, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely combination of elements, title and surrealism.  Love it.</td>', 'Lovely combination of elements, title and surrealism.  Love it.', '2006-12-17 11:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
