(3125808, 434836, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Makes me wonder what is the story behind this individual.  Even the grungy background fits the shot!<br/>TC</td>', 'Love this shot.  Makes me wonder what is the story behind this individual.  Even the grungy background fits the shot!TC', '2006-12-17 14:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
