(3127304, 435548, 69260, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot Ros, terribly surprising with the contrast of the child''s face and his hands !  The technical aspect of the shot is remarkable and the final result is wonderful !<br/>Congratulations.<br/>Pol</td>', 'Excellent shot Ros, terribly surprising with the contrast of the child''s face and his hands !  The technical aspect of the shot is remarkable and the final result is wonderful !Congratulations.Pol', '2006-12-18 01:39:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3127315, 436828, 62095, '<td valign="top">This was one of my challenge favourites.  Nice position!</td>', 'This was one of my challenge favourites.  Nice position!', '2006-12-18 01:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3127318, 436796, 66635, '<td valign="top">Man this was a tough one!  I must have taken 100 pictures of my dog digging and this one was the best exposure I got.  Across the board, they were underexposed.  I brightened this one in PP -- something I''m still below novice in.  I think it was the contrast of the white wall and the dark dirt, but I simply could not get it right.  I knew it wasn''t good when I put it in, but I thought it was fun.  Even with a poor picture, though, I''m learning from the feedback.  Thank you.</td>', 'Man this was a tough one!  I must have taken 100 pictures of my dog digging and this one was the best exposure I got.  Across the board, they were underexposed.  I brightened this one in PP -- something I''m still below novice in.  I think it was the contrast of the white wall and the dark dirt, but I simply could not get it right.  I knew it wasn''t good when I put it in, but I thought it was fun.  Even with a poor picture, though, I''m learning from the feedback.  Thank you.', '2006-12-18 01:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3127328, 435803, 48245, '<td valign="top">This is a really good and powerful photo. Should have done better in the scoring. Good Job!</td>', 'This is a really good and powerful photo. Should have done better in the scoring. Good Job!', '2006-12-18 01:50:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3127332, 436848, 60862, '<td valign="top">Well, I''d say you did a great job of processing!  Heck, I might''ve looked at that original and said "ah, never mind."</td>', 'Well, I''d say you did a great job of processing!  Heck, I might''ve looked at that original and said "ah, never mind."', '2006-12-18 01:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
