(3128210, 436905, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a really creative take on dirt with just the one breast covered. There is something that looks a bit forced in the pose - like the model is not "comfortable in her own skin." The dirt on the chin also detracts from the continuity, I think. Do you have any outtakes? Would be interesting to see other poses.</td>', 'This is a really creative take on dirt with just the one breast covered. There is something that looks a bit forced in the pose - like the model is not "comfortable in her own skin." The dirt on the chin also detracts from the continuity, I think. Do you have any outtakes? Would be interesting to see other poses.', '2006-12-18 09:06:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128212, 437005, 55822, '<td valign="top">Congrats man, when going through the entriesthis one stoood out most for me. Your wifes eyes totally make this portrait work. The lightingis as good as ever with you and i like that you shot at 1600, I like the grainy look this adds. Great shot.</td>', 'Congrats man, when going through the entriesthis one stoood out most for me. Your wifes eyes totally make this portrait work. The lightingis as good as ever with you and i like that you shot at 1600, I like the grainy look this adds. Great shot.', '2006-12-18 09:07:42.000000', NULL, 0),
