(3128503, 436664, 62187, '<td valign="top">Here are two lists of comparison showing the major soil compositions of the Earth and Moon (just and FYI)<br/> <br/>Earth:<br/>34% Iron, 29% Oxygen, 15% Silicon, 12% Magnesium, 2% Nickel, 2% Sulfer<br/> <br/>Moon:<br/>42% Oxygen, 21% Silicon, 13% Iron, 8% Calcium, 7% Aluminum, 6% Magnesium<br/> <br/>115 people are telling me they thought my photo was average or below and that they still believe the Moon is made of cheese? You''re kidding me! Oh well...I guess the numbers speak for themselves...it''s Lunacy I say! You just wait ''till I get out my 16" telescope - I''ll put you right inside one of those craters. Then, I''ll dig a hole and cover you with...what?...dirt! Another FYI - the Moon is NOT, I repeat, NOT a Planet - it''s a ''Moon'': an object the revolves around a Planet. A Planet is an object that revolves around a Star, like the Sun. Class dismissed - smoke ''em if ya got ''em.</td>', 'Here are two lists of comparison showing the major soil compositions of the Earth and Moon (just and FYI) Earth:34% Iron, 29% Oxygen, 15% Silicon, 12% Magnesium, 2% Nickel, 2% Sulfer Moon:42% Oxygen, 21% Silicon, 13% Iron, 8% Calcium, 7% Aluminum, 6% Magnesium 115 people are telling me they thought my photo was average or below and that they still believe the Moon is made of cheese? You''re kidding me! Oh well...I guess the numbers speak for themselves...it''s Lunacy I say! You just wait ''till I get out my 16" telescope - I''ll put you right inside one of those craters. Then, I''ll dig a hole and cover you with...what?...dirt! Another FYI - the Moon is NOT, I repeat, NOT a Planet - it''s a ''Moon'': an object the revolves around a Planet. A Planet is an object that revolves around a Star, like the Sun. Class dismissed - smoke ''em if ya got ''em.', '2006-12-18 11:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128509, 437005, 51386, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. I would love to know how you got the eyes! I know it was dark, but i think i would like to see a tiny bit more DOF</td>', 'This is amazing. I would love to know how you got the eyes! I know it was dark, but i think i would like to see a tiny bit more DOF', '2006-12-18 11:09:43.000000', NULL, 0),
