(3128589, 436767, 66384, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6. I think it might be better with the seats cropped off. The color there distracts from the dirt subject. And with the seats gone, the diagonal aspect of the shot isn''t such a problem. Granted, you can''t tell this is a train without the seats, but you sure can tell it''s dirty. And I like the color tones of the metal.</td>', 'I gave this a 6. I think it might be better with the seats cropped off. The color there distracts from the dirt subject. And with the seats gone, the diagonal aspect of the shot isn''t such a problem. Granted, you can''t tell this is a train without the seats, but you sure can tell it''s dirty. And I like the color tones of the metal.', '2006-12-18 12:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128617, 437005, 49480, '<td valign="top">I saw this one as a ribbon.  Great shot, you''re just too good at this.</td>', 'I saw this one as a ribbon.  Great shot, you''re just too good at this.', '2006-12-18 12:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128641, 435548, 19959, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 10 place... I think if the eyes were a little more in focus you''d have a top 3... nice work..</td>', 'Congrats on the top 10 place... I think if the eyes were a little more in focus you''d have a top 3... nice work..', '2006-12-18 12:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128657, 436739, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well I like the composition, and I think it is a valid entry for Dirt. I''ve seen enough dirt to fill in the blanks, and these tools create a lot of blanks. The broom for ________ (floor dirt and sand), The scrub brush for _________ (dirty fur or walls), the forks for _________ (animal dirt), the squeegees for _________ (dirty water and/or windows). Actually you got more dirt into your shot that anyone else in the challenge.<br/> <br/>As I said in my earlier comment, I like the color. The red wall with the red broom , and the touch of red on the squeegee contribute a lot to the composition. If it were my shot, I think I might take out the red on the fork handle.</td>', 'Well I like the composition, and I think it is a valid entry for Dirt. I''ve seen enough dirt to fill in the blanks, and these tools create a lot of blanks. The broom for ________ (floor dirt and sand), The scrub brush for _________ (dirty fur or walls), the forks for _________ (animal dirt), the squeegees for _________ (dirty water and/or windows). Actually you got more dirt into your shot that anyone else in the challenge. As I said in my earlier comment, I like the color. The red wall with the red broom , and the touch of red on the squeegee contribute a lot to the composition. If it were my shot, I think I might take out the red on the fork handle.', '2006-12-18 12:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128678, 435878, 11854, '<td valign="top">I love this! It is just adorable. He''s definitely dirty and this should have scored much higher, IMO.</td>', 'I love this! It is just adorable. He''s definitely dirty and this should have scored much higher, IMO.', '2006-12-18 12:36:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128693, 437005, 50578, '<td valign="top">So we have 5 weeks of this ahead of us?   Nice Shot!...</td>', 'So we have 5 weeks of this ahead of us?   Nice Shot!...', '2006-12-18 12:41:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128697, 436890, 30982, '<td valign="top">What have you done to Patrick??  I don''t remember him being that gray when I was there, was he?  Maybe... Tell him I said hello and thanks for being a patient model with a dummy.  The one in the window - THAT dummy.... sheeesh!  :-)</td>', 'What have you done to Patrick??  I don''t remember him being that gray when I was there, was he?  Maybe... Tell him I said hello and thanks for being a patient model with a dummy.  The one in the window - THAT dummy.... sheeesh!  :-)', '2006-12-18 12:43:16.000000', NULL, 0),
