(3128709, 436828, 42013, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pixelstate:</b></div><hr/><i> Really nice... did you have a fill in flash?<br/>Seems like some reflection in the eyes.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I popped up my onboard flash to give some extra lighting + some selective dodging to lighten the eye whites.</td>', 'Originally posted by Pixelstate: Really nice... did you have a fill in flash?Seems like some reflection in the eyes....   I popped up my onboard flash to give some extra lighting + some selective dodging to lighten the eye whites.', '2006-12-18 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128723, 437086, 3214, '<td valign="top">You''re on quite the roll!  Congrats on the top ten, and go tell Dopey he done good.  ;-)</td>', 'You''re on quite the roll!  Congrats on the top ten, and go tell Dopey he done good.  ;-)', '2006-12-18 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 0),
