(3128860, 435878, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and very well composed.  I saw the other comments about the selective desat but I''m not sure I agree with them.  If you had dark browns for the dirt, there may not have been enough contrast between the two. I think it works well the way it is.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot and very well composed.  I saw the other comments about the selective desat but I''m not sure I agree with them.  If you had dark browns for the dirt, there may not have been enough contrast between the two. I think it works well the way it is.  Good job.', '2006-12-18 14:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128889, 436767, 23484, '<td valign="top">I think the whole angle is wrong.  I think this would be nice if you zoomed out and got more of the train with a couple of people slightly out of focus but had the focus on the dirt. Just my opinion.  I gave it a 5.</td>', 'I think the whole angle is wrong.  I think this would be nice if you zoomed out and got more of the train with a couple of people slightly out of focus but had the focus on the dirt. Just my opinion.  I gave it a 5.', '2006-12-18 14:17:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128894, 437005, 31443, '<td valign="top">Henny deserves a medal for this one Larus! Absolutely a beautiful dirty face :)</td>', 'Henny deserves a medal for this one Larus! Absolutely a beautiful dirty face :)', '2006-12-18 14:18:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3128900, 436848, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think what I like best is the way the lines suck you right in (Sorry if I used too much technical jargon there).  Very nice job on the post processing.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think what I like best is the way the lines suck you right in (Sorry if I used too much technical jargon there).  Very nice job on the post processing.', '2006-12-18 14:21:03.000000', NULL, 0);
