(3129197, 436767, 57229, '<td valign="top">It''s Oslo T-bane (that''s a sort of collective term for trams and underground stuff). I used some noise reduction which I think was a mistake, as dirt = noise = dirt. It''s pretty much a snapshot that I took and entered just because it strikes me as dirty.<br/> <br/>The shot I now regret not taking would have entailed lying on my belly and getting feet, hamburger cartons and all the other ghastly stuff that gets there, as well as including a bit of the aisle.<br/> <br/>Thanks for looking in and commenting.</td>', 'It''s Oslo T-bane (that''s a sort of collective term for trams and underground stuff). I used some noise reduction which I think was a mistake, as dirt = noise = dirt. It''s pretty much a snapshot that I took and entered just because it strikes me as dirty. The shot I now regret not taking would have entailed lying on my belly and getting feet, hamburger cartons and all the other ghastly stuff that gets there, as well as including a bit of the aisle. Thanks for looking in and commenting.', '2006-12-18 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
