(3129577, 436985, 45475, '<td valign="top">Howdy neighbour! :) Congrats on the top 20 too!<br/> <br/>Really liked this and gave you an 8. I think the understated colour was actually a big factor in why I voted highly in the first place and would disagree with the "more saturation" movement. But, different strokes for different folks though, eh? :) Cheers!</td>', 'Howdy neighbour! :) Congrats on the top 20 too! Really liked this and gave you an 8. I think the understated colour was actually a big factor in why I voted highly in the first place and would disagree with the "more saturation" movement. But, different strokes for different folks though, eh? :) Cheers!', '2006-12-18 18:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
